						<a class="share-pinterest" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https://info.paratype.ru/mikrotipograf/&media=https://info.paratype.ru/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/thumb_microtypogr2.svg&description=%D0%9C%D0%B8%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%84+%D0%B2+%D1%88%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82%D0%B5+%E2%80%94+%D1%87%D1%82%D0%BE+%D1%8D%D1%82%D0%BE+%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B5+%D0%B8%26nbsp%3B%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BA+%D0%BE%D0%BD%26nbsp%3B%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%B5%D1%82">Pinterest</a>
						
