						<a class="share-twitter" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Великие шрифты. Futura&url=https://info.paratype.ru/velikie-shrifty-futura/" title="в Твиттере">Twitter</a>
						
						<a class="share-pinterest" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https://info.paratype.ru/velikie-shrifty-futura/&media=https://info.paratype.ru/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/thumb_futura_rc.svg&description=%D0%92%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B5+%D1%88%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82%D1%8B.+Futura">Pinterest</a>
						
