						<a class="share-mail" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="mailto:?subject=I wanted you to see this post&body=Check out this post: Шрифтовая система PT Sans, PT Serif и PT Mono https://info.paratype.ru/shriftovaya-sistema-pt-sans-pt-serif-i-pt-mono/" title="Email this post to a friend">по почте</a>
					</span> <!-- .entry-share-inner-wrap -->
