						<a class="share-twitter" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Как ставить кавычки?&url=https://info.paratype.ru/kak-stavit-kavychki/" title="в Твиттере">Twitter</a>
						
						<a class="share-pinterest" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https://info.paratype.ru/kak-stavit-kavychki/&media=https://info.paratype.ru/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/thumb_quotes_rc.svg&description=%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%BA+%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C+%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%8B%D1%87%D0%BA%D0%B8%3F">Pinterest</a>
						
						<a class="share-mail" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="mailto:?subject=I wanted you to see this post&body=Check out this post: Как ставить кавычки? https://info.paratype.ru/kak-stavit-kavychki/" title="Email this post to a friend">по почте</a>
					</span> <!-- .entry-share-inner-wrap -->
				</span> <!-- .entry-share-wrap -->
			</span> <!-- .entry-share -->
