						<a class="share-twitter" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Великие шрифты. Garamond&url=https://info.paratype.ru/garamond/" title="в Твиттере">Twitter</a>
						
						<a class="share-pinterest" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https://info.paratype.ru/garamond/&media=https://info.paratype.ru/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/thumb_garamondoriginal_rc.svg&description=%D0%92%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B5+%D1%88%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82%D1%8B.+Garamond">Pinterest</a>
						
						<a class="share-mail" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="mailto:?subject=I wanted you to see this post&body=Check out this post: Великие шрифты. Garamond https://info.paratype.ru/garamond/" title="Email this post to a friend">по почте</a>
					</span> <!-- .entry-share-inner-wrap -->
